Upstream code
-------------
Inference follows the official Quickstart in QwenLM/Qwen3-VL
(Apache License 2.0, © Alibaba Cloud / the Qwen team), pinned to SHA
96588727e44c78b25ba03ea03b8e12f7e64fd0da:
https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3-VL

The official upstream LICENSE is copied at LICENSE.upstream. The worker
depends on the released PyPI package qwen-vl-utils==0.0.14 (also Apache-2.0)
but uses AutoProcessor with the official pixel budget for preprocessing, so
the two resize paths are never mixed in one run.

Weights
-------
Default weights are downloaded at runtime from the public Hugging Face catalog
Qwen/Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct (revision ebb281ec70b05090aa6165b016eac8ec08e71b17).
The Hugging Face model card marks them `license: apache-2.0` and `gated: false`.
The weight repositories do not ship a LICENSE file; this NOTICE and the README
record Apache-2.0 and attribute Qwen / Alibaba Cloud. Optional 2B and 8B
Instruct checkpoints use the same license. Weights are **not** baked into the
image.

Do not substitute Qwen2.5-VL-3B (Qwen Research License, non-commercial) or
other Qwen2.5-VL sizes. This listing is Qwen3-VL only.

